Z||000007||DaRkLoRD||07-23-2000||11:46 PM||||Can anyone tell me what the interior diameter of the rubber/plastic tube that goes from the air cleaner into the plenum is?<BR>I'm going to look for some rubber tubing to replace the stock intake with a custom ram air, but I don't know what size to get!<P>also, where can I find a list of the cone filters that K&N makes? I'd like to find one that will fit the Fiero intake and with a *maximum* outer diameter of 5".. (it'd be funny if a Civic filter fit.. lol..)<P>thanks!<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A> <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||5
Z||000008||Philphine||07-24-2000||08:03 AM||||darklord,pepboys and auto zone both have a limited selection of k&n filters. they also have the book with all they offer. i looked up a conical filter a few months back that was around 3 1/2" at the top and not quite 5" at the bottom, and either 5" or 7" tall. at the time i was just getting an idea so i know the numbers are close but not exact. you can check for sure.||||reg||1
